A '''city''' was located on the [[planet]] [[At Attin]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="Real Adventure" /> The city had a downtown with multiple surrounding arcs of suburbs.<ref name="So Much Trouble" /> At its center was a large tower<ref name="Real Adventure" /> known as the [[Supervisor's Tower]]<ref name="No At Attin">{{SkeletonCrew|Can't Say I Remember No At Attin}}</ref> that could be seen from the surrounding [[forest]]s. It has a transportation system where vehicles including [[School tram|school trams]] followed grooves in the roadway. The city had at least one school named [[At Attin Middle School Gamma]].<ref name="Real Adventure" /> A large open field that concealed a landing pad was located in the city and allowed for transit to the underground [[At Attin Mint]].<ref name="So Much Trouble" />

{{City-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The city appeared in the [[Disney+]] live&ndash;action series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'' which began releasing on [[December 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Real Adventure" />

